[{"title":"秋日山斋三首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"幽独抱微痾，淹留奈岁何。\n星霜秋鬓改，风雨莫愁多。\n养素甘泉石，偷生畏网罗。\n年来城府里，无事倦经过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山斋三首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"草白露零砌，叶红霜满林。\n初闻新雁过，知是已秋深。\n病起还扶杖，贫来不卖琴。\n茅檐风日煖，闲坐试孤吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山斋三首 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"寂寞无来客，柴门尽日扃。\n草根吟蟋蟀，竹尾挂蜻蜓。\n爽气岚侵席，秋声叶满庭。\n最怜窗里岫，相对坐閒青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"谢晋","text":"卧久转无力，空庭晓步迟。\n身癯长是病，人说为吟诗。\n帘薄风仍怯，窗明日更宜。\n床头馀药在，凭仗且扶持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼晚眺","author":"谢晋","text":"天静波澄练，江空月近楼。\n露凉花解语，烟暝柳多愁。\n鸥送征帆远，虹随渚雨收。\n几家官渡外，灯火候归舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜雨窗有怀葛秀才炳","author":"谢晋","text":"耿耿不成寐，空城寒漏迟。\n那堪闻雨夜，政是忆君时。\n檐溜时惊梦，虫声暗助悲。\n何当同剪烛，重与话相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"谢晋","text":"天高风露凉，月清桂花冷。\n嘹嘹雁来宾，蔌蔌叶堕井。\n空斋独无寐，兹夕惟念永。\n如何床畔灯，偏照离人影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜陈孝廉继见访","author":"谢晋","text":"空山初雨歇，君忽扣松关。\n林阔衣襟湿，苔深屐齿班。\n吟随清兴发，思共白云闲。\n自愧无兼味，空留到暮还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九前二日题城南书舍壁","author":"谢晋","text":"潇潇风雨暗山房，篱下谁能共一觞。\n独有黄花知节近，殷勤留客过重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿刘徵小敏喜滕校理椿远归","author":"谢晋","text":"故人留宿夜，远客值归时。\n松火鸣茶灶，灯花映酒卮。\n交游看竟少，聚散本无期。\n耿耿俱忘寐，空庭月渐移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将之京留别马从兄敬","author":"谢晋","text":"江馆西风又作寒，同袍还念客衣单。\n相思后夜苏城月，独向丹阳郭里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿阊门","author":"谢晋","text":"霜满乌啼夜月寒，客窗灯火对愁看。\n故园相去无多路，便觉今宵睡不安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过吴道者新居","author":"谢晋","text":"低垣新筑未生苔，僻近城南少客来。\n凿就盆池移石甃，起成道院乞松栽。\n琴尊适兴随时乐，窗户生凉四面开。\n何用别寻方外住，清闲只此是蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹斋秋早","author":"谢晋","text":"云黑树苍苍，回飙动素商。\n高梧鸣急雨，脩竹翳残阳。\n爽气侵书幌，秋声绕石床。\n不知今夜里，添得几分凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日閒居","author":"谢晋","text":"未老先疏懒，间眠爱竹阴。\n石边床几净，风外芰荷深。\n嗜酒从家寠，攻诗带病吟。\n幽居邻古寺，长日有僧寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"谢晋","text":"夏久群嚣息，开轩皓月中。\n乱萤穿薜荔，双鸟宿梧桐。\n冰冷金盘果，凉生水槛风。\n惟愁天易晓，尘事复匆匆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕咏牛女","author":"谢晋","text":"天净月如钩，银河澹欲流。\n鹊桥金背稳，龙驾綵云稠。\n此夜应相见，平明起别愁。\n莫嗟重会杳，倏忽是来秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜有怀王鄜州观","author":"谢晋","text":"孤馆凉生夕，怀君又属秋。\n蛩声四壁雨，灯影一身愁。\n栖泊缘羁旅，飘零总宦游。\n诗成欲脩问，路远恐沉浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"侬家曾住白蘋州，偏堕黄尘已廿秋。\n安得千金如画里，此身仍在钓鱼舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小游仙三首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"偶缘溪路入天台，岚重霞深路不开。\n洞口蓦闻仙乐响，素娥知是有人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小游仙三首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"瑶台月映彤云迥，碧落风吹环佩声。\n试逐群仙何处去，麻姑今夜宴方平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小游仙三首 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"借得刘君一鹤骑，飖飖云汉欲何之。\n偶来暂驻长松下，嬴得秦翁一局棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画为徐山人作","author":"谢晋","text":"扁舟荡漾水云宽，避暑曾游销夏湾。\n好是君家亭子上，捲帘直见洞庭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题苏小小像","author":"谢晋","text":"油碧车轻路去遥，西陵松柏暮潇潇。\n纱窗昨夜黄梅雨，添得钱唐几番潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京师逢陆玘","author":"谢晋","text":"朱雀桥头日未斜，逢君不道在京华。\n明朝又向江南去，一路看山直到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅花翠鸟图","author":"谢晋","text":"月堕参横水竹西，雪晴时节路高低。\n翠禽只恐香零落，几度飞来不忍啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题荔枝山鸟图","author":"谢晋","text":"色欺鹤顶与鸡冠，垂向枝头露尚寒。\n山鸟飞来休恣啄，遐方未贡到长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词五首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"高出离宫覆御塘，暖烟晴日斗新收。\n舞腰妒尽东风力，恨不移枝出建章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词五首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"垂似缀旒笼似盖，远如轻雾淡如烟。\n陶家旧日应堪羡，一任春阴蔽县前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词五首 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"驿路溪桥野店傍，几株摇曳复遮藏。\n年来频为行人折，无复柔条似旧长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词五首 其四","author":"谢晋","text":"纤腰困舞非因态，眉黛长颦岂为愁。\n张绪料应今已老，可怜无复旧风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词五首 其五","author":"谢晋","text":"媚眼蒙茸半入春，妆楼舞榭一时新。\n谁能更近苏台种，教得吴娃尽效颦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"溪馆阴森夏木齐，雨晴新绿覆檐低。\n清风不为尘来扫，黄鸟多因客去啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"竹树清清水一溪，板桥南去草堂西。\n兴来自爱寻诗到，不意兼听好鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"琴为荒凉久断弦，简因零落不成编。\n醉来惟爱矶边草，留得茸茸待我眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其四","author":"谢晋","text":"杨柳青青水满塘，荷衣初试晚风凉。\n偶来亭下微吟罢，试数新篁几个长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其五","author":"谢晋","text":"云木苍苍夏雨过，望中樵径入烟萝。\n山中惟欠流莺语，花比春深也较多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其六","author":"谢晋","text":"遥遥刳木引泉过，霭霭茶霏散碧萝。\n芝涧忽闻山雨到，竹窗分得夜凉多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居初夏七首次王校理韵 其七","author":"谢晋","text":"寂寂荆扉竹里扃，种瓜人去雨冥冥。\n一尊长恨无来客，閒住花间自醉醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"谢晋","text":"湘帘半捲树鸣蜩，风露凄清玉漏迢。\n素扇青奴浑不用，卧看凉月上庭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"谢晋","text":"门轩湖水北，四面芙蓉渚。\n望望楚天遥，孤帆带飞雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"谢晋","text":"寒蛩不可听，况复起清砧。\n落叶将飞雨，潇潇又满林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜宿钱经客舍","author":"谢晋","text":"听断春鸠竹外鸣，客窗微雨夜初晴。\n他乡遇旧偏多感，对酒论交分有情。\n千里归心随蝶梦，半帘斜月送鸡声。\n何时共汝还山去，剪烛连床话旧盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客金陵送盛寅还吴","author":"谢晋","text":"宫柳笼阴半已青，俄闻归棹发金陵。\n秦淮雪尽春潮长，楚甸云开晓日升。\n先我还家缘客久，如君多艺更谁能。\n莫辞同醉长干酒，明日相思恨不胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送俞立庵应湘府聘","author":"谢晋","text":"鹤书远聘到岩阿，拜手幡然出薜萝。\n天接孤帆秋水阔，门开五柳夕阳多。\n吴云渐杳乡边树，湘雨微生渚外波。\n此去贤王应待久，安车行旆莫蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"羽士清真侣，斋居苍翠间。\n偶临溪水上，却望云中山。\n日夕钟磬发，应寻旧路还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"逍遥西涧翁，邂逅南垞客。\n为解杖头瓢，坐饮林下石。\n微醉两忘还，秋山竟云夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日雨窗有怀一二同志","author":"谢晋","text":"诗坛酒社久凋零，每遇良辰忆旧盟。\n四海弟兄何日会，满天风雨几时晴。\n青春有恨愁边过，白发无情暗里生。\n不道今朝又佳节，竟无人话是清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南湖小景","author":"谢晋","text":"南湖三月春水大，射鸭船从菰上过。\n村前载耜唱歌声，村后罱泥相应和。\n红桃开处见一簇，白鸥飞来时两个。\n我家亦在此湖近，惟爱垂竿对山坐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自述","author":"谢晋","text":"疏狂浑不称儒名，三十年来一未成。\n留客未尝教便去，寻僧多半为闲行。\n只愁酒尽黄花老，任取秋深白发生。\n近欲衣冠如古制，原头野老莫相惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日雨中留饮千氏书楼","author":"谢晋","text":"一声新雁起平川，秋水瀰茫接远天。\n人倚碧阑干外雨，舟横芳草渡头烟。\n归来举世无元亮，感慨斯时有仲宣。\n今日故人皆满座，不妨沉醉菊花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿开元精舍","author":"谢晋","text":"落日树阴阴，禅幽静客心。\n香烟秋殿寂，灯火夜厨深。\n茗熟僧先睡，诗成佛对吟。\n自怜耽僻志，只合卧云林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长至日喜友人见过","author":"谢晋","text":"今朝风日好，喜见一阳回。\n檐鹊翻晴噪，家僮报客来。\n履长忻有贺，献颂愧无才。\n且共酬佳节，深深劝酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6622,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得秦淮夜泊送吴秀才归吴","author":"谢晋","text":"烟雾淡笼月，泊舟依浅沙。\n且沽今夕酒，听唱后庭花。\n淮水迎归路，吴山看到家。\n乡中莫留滞，慈母在京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6623,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送葛南伯之洪澹巡检","author":"谢晋","text":"蜀中当俊杰，要剑入南闽。\n夜逻龙溪外，秋吟海岛滨。\n青山围镇市，画戟拥诗人。\n群盗知先遁，禁书好更亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6624,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春送徐枚理还越","author":"谢晋","text":"渺渺湖光远，离情奈若何。\n花香随去舫，柳色蘸青波。\n晓雨晴吴甸，春寒峭越罗。\n云归千嶂尽，雪在半篷多。\n酒向愁边贳，诗从醉里哦。\n行装书错杂，归路岭嵯峨。\n南度烟中望，西陵月下过。\n还家应访旧，清兴莫蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6625,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送传世南","author":"谢晋","text":"杨柳古城边，风光触处妍。\n画船轻似鹢，春水阔于天。\n歌断人将别，帆开月正悬。\n回看五云际，雕鹗去翩翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪唐陆二秀才游天禧寺分韵得池字","author":"谢晋","text":"同是殊乡客，因閒偶暂期。\n相携游帝里，幸得到天禧。\n境胜尘寰隔，禅幽静者宜。\n御香曾降日，鸾辂每游时。\n讲后僧归院，斋馀鸟下墀。\n珠林花绰约，杏阁燕参池。\n探古巡廊久，行吟出寺迟。\n登临独惆怅，后会杳难知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜有怀金徵士潜","author":"谢晋","text":"秋声随处起，落叶暗庭除。\n积雨生苔厚，閒云映竹虚。\n湿萤凉入幔，黠鼠夜翻书。\n遥想维摩伴，安居独晏如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日怀沈大本","author":"谢晋","text":"茱萸红映绛纱囊，旧俗犹传费长房。\n身健喜逢高处饮，老来不觉醉时狂。\n已拚乌帽迎风落，任取黄花插鬓香。\n眼底故人惟沈约，每逢佳节入他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送韩医士之京受冠带","author":"谢晋","text":"药裹诗囊共一船，春风相引去朝天。\n宫槐过雨沾行旆，林杏飘香度别筵。\n术学试趋丹阙下，衣冠归拜采庭前。\n莫言微禄亏亲养，樻券还能助俸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱孝廉起复","author":"谢晋","text":"通波亭下水如天，送子离情倍黯然。\n读礼已终三载后，辞家又向五云边。\n壶觞杂坐依林草，箫鼓齐鸣动祖筵。\n日暮分携凝望处，风帆渐远孝廉船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈大本","author":"谢晋","text":"幕府门西初见时，一言投分即相知。\n几年别去身多难，今日归来鬓有丝。\n茂苑江山皆旧恨，小齐卮酒总新期。\n何缘蠲了遐方戍，长共吟窗计较诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游西坞","author":"谢晋","text":"久作还山计，于今渐有缘。\n终当来此处，盘礴听风泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中岁尽寓怀","author":"谢晋","text":"江边摇落景萧疏，客里愁惊岁暗除。\n寒沼有冰胶破砚，晚窗无雪照残书。\n青窥柳眼迎春笑，粉妒梅容待腊舒。\n自叹新年归未得，故园桃李复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋送刘人材","author":"谢晋","text":"絺绤含风晚气清，凄凄离恨似凉生。\n伊州歌罢人初别，何处飞来雁一声。\n白露半江秋月皎，青霄万里暮云平。\n金貂换取新丰酒，重醉炉头送长卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋夜不见月","author":"谢晋","text":"拟向中秋玩月来，朱弦拂拭酒新醅。\n阴云忍到今宵暗，不放霜娥下玉台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪居春晚","author":"谢晋","text":"残红堆径厚于苔，偶与寻诗晚步来。\n只道春光归已尽，隔溪犹有野棠开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"远汀飞尽一双凫，烟树迢迢映绿芜。\n何似载书兼载酒，樵青摇出女儿湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题辋川图","author":"谢晋","text":"木兰紫近辛夷坞，芳树高高结翠阴。\n回首辋川裴迪老，不知谁与伴行吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钱经二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"秋云漠漠树离离，孤馆俄惊雨后时。\n明日风帆江上路，看山应起故园思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钱经二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"乌府归来未白头，相逢不道又深秋。\n故园亲友知多少，若个能来慰别愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桃源图","author":"谢晋","text":"细草幽花山洞春，春深闲却种桃人。\n源头不放渔舟入，尘世那知有遁秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]